canela (0.1.37) unstable; urgency=low

  * MIRCO REPL in the background: Compute MIRCO Line and Compute MIRCO
    REPL Again no longer hold the window; each answer appears when it
    is computed.
  * A click on the head of a MIRCO cell (▶ MIRCO · name) runs the cells.
  * A cell after a failed one says "Nicht gelaufen" instead of an empty
    "Fehler:".
  * Code blocks show their language or the MIRCO head on a line of their
    own; the outputs of MIRCO lie on a green ground.
  * Long lines of code wrap under their indentation.
  * The return and command signs are drawn as text, not as emoji.
  * SVG texts turned by a quarter turn are drawn (the y label of plots).

